resolve-aacfix 0.1.1: locate gate1 whatever register holds the fourcc

Resolve 21.1.1 keeps the QuickTime fourcc in r12d instead of r15d, so the
gate1_dispatch signature (cmp r15d,'.mp3'; je) no longer matches and the
patcher refuses the build.  Wildcard the ModRM byte, verify with capstone
that the hit is `cmp r8d..r15d, '.mp3'`, and hand the register read off the
binary to the trampoline instead of the hard-coded r15.  21.1 (r15d) still
resolves to the same site.

